{"text":"Empowered by technology, you are connecting and collaborating like never before, on Facebook and WhatsApp and Twitter. And chances are, you're talking to someone in America, your friends or your cousins. The United States has the largest Indian diaspora in the world, including some 3 million proud Indian Americans. And they make America stronger, and they tie us together, bonds of family and friendship that allow us to share in each other's success. So for all these reasons, India and the United States are not just natural partners. I believe America can be India's best partner. I believe that. Of course, only Indians can decide India's role in the world. But I'm here because I'm absolutely convinced that both our peoples will have more jobs and opportunity, and our nations will be more secure, and the world will be safer.","words":[{"text":"Empowered","start":0.92,"end":1.56},{"text":"by","start":1.56,"end":1.8},{"text":"technology","start":1.8,"end":2.4,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":3.02,"end":3.08},{"text":"are","start":3.08,"end":3.24},{"text":"connecting","start":3.24,"end":3.7},{"text":"and","start":3.7,"end":4.0},{"text":"collaborating","start":4.0,"end":4.5},{"text":"like","start":4.5,"end":4.72},{"text":"never","start":4.72,"end":4.96},{"text":"before","start":4.96,"end":5.34,"punct":","},{"text":"on","start":5.94,"end":6.08},{"text":"Facebook","start":6.08,"end":6.52},{"text":"and","start":6.52,"end":7.14},{"text":"WhatsApp","start":7.14,"end":7.92},{"text":"and","start":7.92,"end":8.48},{"text":"Twitter","start":8.48,"end":9.02,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":10.56,"end":10.66},{"text":"chances","start":10.66,"end":10.86},{"text":"are","start":10.86,"end":11.12,"punct":","},{"text":"you're","start":11.14,"end":11.3},{"text":"talking","start":11.3,"end":11.56},{"text":"to","start":11.56,"end":11.78},{"text":"someone","start":11.78,"end":12.0},{"text":"in","start":12.0,"end":12.3},{"text":"America","start":12.3,"end":12.62,"punct":","},{"te